 -pizza-parade-day-opening-2026-10-11\n\nTony's Pizza Napoletana in North 
 Beach opens early at 11:30am on Sunday\, October 11 for the Italian Herit
 age Parade\, serving pizza in the neighbourhood during the parade-day act
 ion. The restaurant's regular Friday through Sunday hours are 12pm to 11p
 m\, and this early opening is timed for the parade. The date falls during
  Fleet Week in San Francisco.
